        "text": "=LEAD: {{ $('Normalize').first().json.first_name }} {{ $('Normalize').first().json.last_name }} | {{ $('Normalize').first().json.job_title }} | {{ $('Normalize').first().json.company_name }} | {{ $('Normalize').first().json.lead_email }}\nEMAIL TYPE: {{ $('Normalize').first().json.is_freemail ? \"PERSONAL/FREEMAIL — domain is the email provider, NOT the company; web-search the real company + phone\" : \"business domain\" }}\nLOCATION: {{ $('Normalize').first().json.city }}, {{ $('Normalize').first().json.state }}, {{ $('Normalize').first().json.country_code }}\nDOMAIN: {{ $('Normalize').first().json.domain }}\n\nCOMPANY FIRMOGRAPHICS (DiscoLike, empty/ignore for freemail):\n{{ JSON.stringify($('DiscoLike BizData').first().json) }}\n\nCONTACT ENRICHMENT (may be empty for role inboxes or freemail):\nphone: {{ $json.contact_phone }} | seniority: {{ $json.contact_seniority }} | title: {{ $json.contact_title }} | summary: {{ $json.contact_summary }}\n\nPROSPECT LATEST REPLY:\n{{ $('Format Thread').first().json.reply_text }}\n\nRECENT EXCHANGE (our last message, then their reply — use this to interpret short replies like \"sure\"/\"yes\"):\n{{ $('Format Thread').first().json.last_two }}\n\nRun the qualification. Output structured JSON, and include a \"situation_summary\": ONE plain-English line (max 140 chars) stating what the prospect signaled and what they want next, interpreting the latest reply IN CONTEXT of our last message. Resolve vague replies like \"sure\"/\"yes\"/\"ok\" into the actual thing they agreed to or asked for (e.g. \"Said yes to a quick walkthrough video\" or \"Asked us to send more on how it works before a call\"). Never paste the raw reply verbatim; no names, signatures, or URLs.",
